<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Healer Weapons</h1>
<p>The weapon skills the Healers' guild of Udgaard teaches. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the weapon there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>). Each weapon has its own help: help and the weapon's name.
</p>
<pre>Name           Level   Up to
Mace               0   100%
Fist               1   80%
War Hammer         4   90%
Club               6   70%
Quarterstaff       8   100%
Morning Star      20   70%
Flail             34   70%
Battle Club       36   70%
Battle Mace       48   90%
Maul              50   90%
</pre>
<p><br />
